return ['domain'=>'wpml-import','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'WPML Export and Import 5.0.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-15T17:43:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['WPML Export and Import'=>'WPML Export and Import','https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/wpml-export-and-import/'=>'https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/wpml-export-and-import/','A multipurpose plugin to export and import multilingual content.'=>'一个用于导出和导入多语言内容的多功能插件。','OnTheGoSystems'=>'OnTheGoSystems','http://www.onthegosystems.com'=>'http://www.onthegosystems.com','The import trigger no longer accepts the key in the URL. Send it in a POST body.'=>'导入触发器不再接受 URL 中的密钥。请在 POST 正文中发送。','Method Not Allowed'=>'不允许的方法','Unauthorized'=>'未授权','No items to process'=>'没有要处理的项目','No Content'=>'无内容','Import process completed'=>'导入过程已完成','Success'=>'成功','Import process failed'=>'导入过程失败','Internal Server Error'=>'内部服务器错误','%1$s: %2$d item could not be processed and was skipped.'=>'%1$s：%2$d 个项目无法处理并已跳过。','Cleaning Up Post Data'=>'正在清理文章数据','Removing temporary and import-related post meta data.'=>'正在删除临时的以及与导入相关的文章元数据。','Cleaning Up Term Data'=>'正在清理分类词数据','Removing temporary and import-related term meta data.'=>'正在删除临时的以及与导入相关的分类词元数据。','Connecting Post Image Attachments'=>'正在关联文章图像附件','Updating thumbnail and gallery attachment IDs on translated posts, products, and CPTs to point to their translated equivalents.'=>'正在更新已翻译文章、产品和自定义文章类型上的缩略图和图库附件 ID，以指向其对应的翻译件。','Connecting Inline Term Translations'=>'正在关联内联分类词翻译','Scanning posts with a single taxonomy term in order to identify and connect the terms assigned to these posts with their translations.'=>'正在扫描仅包含单个分类法分类词的文章，以便识别这些文章所属的分类词并将其与其翻译进行关联。','Deleting Obsolete Original Terms'=>'正在删除过时的原始分类词','Removing original terms that are no longer needed after creating duplicates for same-named terms. Ensuring no posts are linked to these original terms.'=>'正在删除为同名分类词创建副本后不再需要的原始分类词。确保没有文章链接到这些原始分类词。','Duplicating Terms with Shared Names Across Languages'=>'正在跨语言复制同名分类词','Creating duplicates in the correct language for terms that share the same name across languages, but belong to posts in different languages.'=>'正在为跨语言同名但属于不同语言文章的分类词创建对应语言的副本。','Fixing Imported Post Slugs'=>'正在修复导入的文章别名','Regenerating translated post slugs to prevent conflicts with the originals.'=>'正在重新生成已翻译的文章别名，以防止与原始文章冲突。','Clearing Translations Cache'=>'正在清理翻译缓存','Invalidating the persistent cache so it can be regenerated.'=>'使持久缓存失效以便重新生成。','Marking Parent Terms for Connection'=>'正在标记待关联的父级分类词','Collecting parent terms to connect their translations in the next step.'=>'正在收集父级分类词，以便在下一步中关联它们的翻译。','Connecting Posts with Correct Term Translations'=>'正在将文章与正确的分类词翻译关联','Ensuring posts are connected to terms in the correct language, especially if you have the same term names across languages.'=>'确保文章关联到正确语言的分类词，特别是当您在不同语言中拥有相同的分类词名称时。','Sending Posts for Automatic Translation'=>'正在发送文章进行自动翻译','Creating automatic translation jobs for posts flagged for auto-translation in the exported data.'=>'正在为导出数据中标记为自动翻译的文章创建自动翻译作业。','Setting Attachments\' Language'=>'正在设置附件语言','Assigning a language to imported attachments.'=>'正在为导入的附件分配语言。','Updating Final Post Status'=>'正在更新最终文章状态','Setting the post status based on the "_wpml_import_after_process_post_status" field from the import file (if provided).'=>'根据导入文件中的“_wpml_import_after_process_post_status”字段（如果提供）设置文章状态。','Identifying Inline Term Languages'=>'正在识别内联分类词语言','Identifying and setting the language of terms created during post imports.'=>'正在识别并设置文章导入期间创建的分类词的语言。','Setting Posts’ Language'=>'正在设置文章语言','Connecting posts to the default language and translations.'=>'正在将文章关联到默认语言和翻译。','Setting Terms’ Language'=>'正在设置分类词语言','Connecting taxonomy terms to the default (original) language and translations.'=>'正在将分类法分类词关联到默认（原始）语言和翻译。','Setting Parent Terms\' Language'=>'正在设置