'正在以正确的语言设置向上销售、交叉销售和分组产品引用。','Importing Custom Attribute Labels'=>'正在导入自定义属性标签','Importing labels for product-specific (custom) attributes from the exported data.'=>'正在从导出数据中导入特定于产品（自定义）属性的标签。','You are about to export all your products in all languages at once.'=>'您即将一次性导出所有语言的所有产品。','Remember to install %1$s and %2$s on your new site before importing your content so we can restore all the translations.'=>'请记得在导入内容之前，先在您的新站点上安装 %1$s 和 %2$s，以便我们可以恢复所有翻译。','You are about to export your products in %s.'=>'您即将导出 %s 中的产品。','Registering Product Attributes'=>'正在注册产品属性','Identifying and registering attributes created during product imports for translation.'=>'正在识别并注册产品导入期间创建的属性以进行翻译。','Identifying Product Attribute Languages'=>'正在识别产品属性语言','Identifying and setting the language of attributes created during product imports.'=>'正在识别并设置产品导入期间创建的属性的语言。','Export and Import'=>'导出和导入','I’m using the built-in %s export/import tool'=>'我正在使用内置的 %s 导出/导入工具','I’m using %s plugin'=>'我正在使用 %s 插件','(%1$d/%2$d items)'=>'（%1$d/%2$d 个项目）','%d skipped'=>'已跳过 %d 个','(no items)'=>'（无项目）','Counting items...'=>'正在统计项目...','First, tell us how you’re going to create the content that you’ll be importing:'=>'首先，告诉我们您将如何创建要导入的内容：','Continue'=>'继续','I’m using %1$s and %2$s plugins'=>'我正在使用 %1$s 和 %2$s 插件','I’m using a different method to export from this site'=>'我正在使用其他方法从此站点导出','I’m exporting the content from this site'=>'我正在从此站点导出内容','I’m exporting the content from a different website or system'=>'我正在从其他网站或系统导出内容','Before importing, add language columns to your content'=>'在导入之前，请为您的内容添加语言列','Make sure that your import file includes the following columns (custom fields) with language information:'=>'请确保您的导入文件包含以下带有语言信息的列（自定义字段）：','%s: A value that’s the same for all the translations of each item. In e-commerce sites this will often be the SKU.'=>'%s：每个项目的所有翻译都相同的值。在电子商务网站中，这通常是 SKU。','%s: The language code for each item.'=>'%s：每个项目的语言代码。','And, you can include these two columns if needed:'=>'并且，如果需要，